          {
            "title": "If 1",
            "id": 52871,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare la lunghezza di un array per creare <strong>istruzioni condizionali</strong> che dipendono dal numero dei suoi elementi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (tasks.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ugh, more work!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Ugh, more work!\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "If 2",
            "id": 52872,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fai una prova: mostra il messaggio solo se <code>tasks.length</code> è maggiore di <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (tasks.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ugh, more work!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Ugh, more work!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>tasks.length</code>, seguito da <code>&gt;</code> e infine <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza <code>Ugh, more work!</code> solo se l'array contiene almeno un'attività. Confronta la sua lunghezza a sinistra con zero.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (tasks.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ugh, more work!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Ugh, more work!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>tasks.length</code>, seguito da <code>&gt;</code> e infine <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 52873,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche usare la lunghezza di un array per creare <strong>cicli for</strong> che attraversano tutti i suoi elementi.</p><p>A questo scopo, ripetiamo un ciclo tante volte quanti sono gli elementi nell'array usando la proprietà <code>length</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Eve&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; friends.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Ana\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Eve\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Sam\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Two executions",
            "id": 52874,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ripeti il ciclo for due volte specificando che <code>i</code> deve essere minore del <code>length</code> dell'array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; friends.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i &gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Anna\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Tim\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>i &lt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ripeti il ciclo for due volte specificando che <code>i</code> deve essere minore del <code>length</code> dell'array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; friends.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"friends\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Anna\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Tim\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>i</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;</code> e infine <code>friends.length</code>.</p></body></html>"
